"余音是一款轻量的播客客户端：发现好节目、订阅收听、离线下载、随时续播，专注「听」本身。macOS 版只使用系统自带的框架，不引入任何第三方 SDK。" = "Reverb is a lightweight podcast client: discover shows, subscribe and listen, download for offline, and resume anytime — focused on listening itself. The macOS build uses only Apple's system frameworks and bundles no third-party SDKs.";
"主要功能" = "Features";
"· 发现：按地区与分类浏览每日热门" = "· Discover: browse daily charts by region and category";
"· 搜索：按名字或直接粘贴 RSS 地址" = "· Search: by name or by pasting an RSS URL";
"· 视频链接：粘贴 B 站视频链接或 BV 号，直接当单集听（不登录；视频来源的单集不提供下载）" = "· Video links: paste a Bilibili video link or BV ID and listen to it as an episode (no sign-in; episodes from video links cannot be downloaded)";
"· 频道分享：生成含 Logo、频道名、简介与余音落款的图片" = "· Share shows: create an image with the logo, show name, description and a Reverb signature";
"· 电台：随机漫游，或按时段与情境推荐" = "· Radio: roam at random, or get picks by time of day and context";
"· 追更：订阅频道播过的单集全在这一栏，按时间倒序翻看，可在页头手动刷新，可单独设这一栏的播放模式" = "· Updates: every episode of your subscribed shows in one column, newest first; refresh from the header and give this column its own play mode";
"· 音阁：订阅、收藏、下载、待播、历史、批注六栏管理" = "· Library: subscriptions, favorites, downloads, up next, history and notes in six sections";
"· 批量与直达：点任意单集封面直达它所属的频道；多个列表可切换「选择」把一批一次加入待播" = "· Batch and jump: click any episode cover to open its show; several lists have a Select mode to add a batch to Up Next at once";
"· 离线下载：下载的单集长期留在本机" = "· Offline: downloaded episodes stay on this Mac";
"· 播放缓存：播过的单集自动留在本机，下次直接本地起播；断网时已加载的列表与封面仍可浏览，可在设置一键清除" = "· Playback cache: episodes you play stay on this Mac and start locally next time; loaded lists and artwork remain browsable offline, clearable in Settings";
"· 播放：倍速、快进快退、睡眠定时、播放模式（顺序 / 单曲循环 / 随机）、自动续播，以及系统媒体键与「正在播放」" = "· Playback: speed, skip back and forward, sleep timer, play modes (in order / repeat one / shuffle), autoplay next, plus media keys and Now Playing";
"· 逐字稿：优先显示发布方提供的逐字稿，没有时在本机转成文字并随进度高亮（本机转写需 macOS 26）" = "· Transcript: shows the publisher’s transcript when there is one, otherwise turns the episode into text on this Mac, highlighted as it plays (on-device transcription needs macOS 26)";
