"余音是一款轻量的播客客户端：发现好节目、订阅收听、离线下载、随时续播，专注「听」本身。iOS 版只使用系统自带的框架，不引入任何第三方 SDK。" = "Reverb is a lightweight podcast client: discover shows, subscribe and listen, download for offline, and resume anytime — focused on listening itself. The iOS build uses only Apple's system frameworks and bundles no third-party SDKs.";
"余音 iOS 版只使用系统自带的框架，不引入任何第三方 SDK 或统计组件。以下是所用的系统能力与数据来源。" = "The iOS build uses only Apple's system frameworks and bundles no third-party SDKs or analytics. Here are the system capabilities and data sources it uses.";
"余音以本机处理为主。没有开发者后端、账号、广告、统计、归因、第三方登录、第三方推送、崩溃上报或跨应用追踪。订阅、历史、收藏、下载、收听统计、设置、批注与运行日志都在本机处理，不会自动上传给开发者；iOS 版只使用系统自带的框架，不含任何第三方 SDK。若你在系统设置里开启了 iCloud 备份，系统会把本机数据一并备份到你自己的 iCloud 空间。" = "Reverb processes most data on your device. It has no developer backend, account, ads, analytics, attribution, third-party login or push, crash reporting, or cross-app tracking. Subscriptions, history, favorites, downloads, listening statistics, settings, notes and runtime logs are processed locally and are not automatically uploaded to the developer. The iOS build uses only Apple's system frameworks and bundles no third-party SDKs. If you enable iCloud Backup in Settings, the system backs this data up to your own iCloud storage along with the rest of your device.";
"· 直播流：粘贴一条网络电台/直播流地址直接收听" = "· Live streams: paste a radio or live-stream URL and listen right away";
"· 播放：倍速、快进快退、睡眠定时、播放模式（顺序 / 单曲循环 / 随机）与自动续播" = "· Playback: speed, skip back and forward, sleep timer, play modes (in order / repeat one / shuffle) and autoplay next";
"· 后台播放：锁屏或切到其他应用后继续播放，支持锁屏遥控与「正在播放」" = "· Background playback: keeps playing when the screen is locked or you switch apps, with lock-screen controls and Now Playing";
"· 逐字稿：优先显示发布方提供的逐字稿，没有时在本机转成文字并随进度高亮（本机转写需 iOS 26）；支持全文搜索，可导出为文本或 Markdown 分享" = "· Transcript: shows the publisher’s transcript when there is one, otherwise turns the episode into text on this device, highlighted as it plays (on-device transcription needs iOS 26); full-text search, and export as text or Markdown to share";
"· 节目笔记：播放页查看简介" = "· Show notes: read the description on the player";
"· 章节：发布方给了章表的单集，播放页进度条上方显示当前章节，点开可跳转；章表取一次后离线也能看" = "· Chapters: for episodes whose publisher ships a chapter list, the current chapter appears above the seek bar; tap to jump. The list is cached once fetched, so it works offline";
"· 外观：深色 / 浅色 / 跟随系统、主题配色、多语言" = "· Appearance: dark / light / system, accent color, multiple languages";
"在播放页查看逐字稿,完全离线转录当前单集(需 iOS 26,首次按语言下载模型)" = "Show the transcript on the player and transcribe the current episode entirely offline (requires iOS 26; the language model downloads on first use)";
"· 追更：订阅频道播过的单集全在这一栏，按时间倒序翻看" = "· Updates: every episode of your subscribed shows in one column, newest first";
